\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a6215e2 elementor-blockquote--skin-border elementor-widget elementor-widget-blockquote\" data-id=\"a6215e2\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"blockquote.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<blockquote class=\"elementor-blockquote\">\n\t\t\t<p class=\"elementor-blockquote__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<i>Original Equipment Manufacturer (OEM)<\/i> - Design owner or manufacturer of the traceable assembled equipment, single equipment unit, or component part. <br><br><i>Certified Equipment Manufacturer (CEM) <\/i>- Design owner or remanufacturer of the traceable current assembled equipment, single equipment unit, or component part responsible for the current product definition (CPD).\t\t\t<\/p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-q-footer\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<cite class=\"elementor-blockquote__author\">American Petroleum Institute (API)<\/cite>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/blockquote>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c30d744 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"c30d744\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>The major modification to this connector involved changing the API 6A 18-3\/4-15k studded top to a 18-3\/4-15k open hole flange top. This allowed the attachment of a double-studded adapter, providing additional height required by the client as well as the gasket profile.\u00a0<\/p><p>We also designed and manufactured a 16-3\/4-10k test stump for use with this connector and a 18-3\/4-15k spacer spool for a 18-3\/4 super heavy H4 connector.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a9a2de2 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=